From: Lars Wikman <lars@underjord.io>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: rover: keep crash logs in ramoops

Reserve a megabyte for pstore's RAM backend, so the kernel log, a panic
and userspace's pmsg records (erlinit's breadcrumbs) survive a reset and
show up in /sys/fs/pstore on the next boot. The layout is the msm8953
phones' (msm8953-xiaomi-tissot); the region is ordinary RAM here.

Signed-off-by: Lars Wikman <lars@underjord.io>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm429w-mobvoi-rover.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm429w-mobvoi-rover.dts
@@ -86,6 +86,15 @@
 			reg = <0x0 0x90001000 0x0 (454 * 454 * 3)>;
 			no-map;
 		};
+
+		ramoops@9ff00000 {
+			compatible = "ramoops";
+			reg = <0x0 0x9ff00000 0x0 0x00100000>;
+			record-size = <0x1000>;
+			console-size = <0x80000>;
+			ftrace-size = <0x1000>;
+			pmsg-size = <0x8000>;
+		};
 	};
 
 	wifi_vqmmc: wifi-vqmmc-regulator {
-- 
2.43.0
